    "text_full": "Help Center\nLogin\nProduct\nSolutions\nResources\nAPI\nPlans & Pricing\nTry for Free\nRequest a Demo\nBack to listing\nBLUEINK + SERVICEDESK\nSupercharge IT Operations with Blueink + ServiceDesk\n\nStreamline ticketing and document workflows by integrating Blueink with ServiceDesk. Empower your IT team to manage signatures, documents, and service requests—without ever leaving their ITSM environment.\n\nGet a demo\nAutomate Document Workflows\nDirectly from ServiceDesk\nSend Envelopes Automatically When Requests Are Submitted\n\nWhen a new request is submitted in ServiceDesk—such as for equipment access or software installation—Blueink can automatically send the required document for eSignature. No more manual uploads or chasing signatures via email.\n\nTrigger New ServiceDesk Requests from Completed Envelopes\n\nOnce an envelope is signed and completed in Blueink, a corresponding request can be generated in ServiceDesk. It’s a seamless way to keep your IT records up to date—ideal for approvals, audits, and onboarding milestones.\n\nRoute Documents to the Right People Instantly\n\nNeed a department head to approve a hardware request? Blueink can pull signer details directly from the ServiceDesk ticket, ensuring the right person receives the right document—without delays or manual input.\n\nWho Uses the Blueink for ServiceDesk Integration?\nIT\nHandle equipment access forms, software installation approvals, and vendor agreements with ease. Blueink + ServiceDesk automates document workflows so your IT team can focus on keeping systems running—not chasing signatures.\nHR\nSimplify onboarding, policy acknowledgments, and leave request approvals. Blueink + ServiceDesk helps HR teams send, sign, and track critical documents—all from within their existing service management environment.\nOperations\nKeep facilities requests, maintenance approvals, and compliance documents moving efficiently. With Blueink + ServiceDesk, Operations teams can route and store signed paperwork seamlessly, ensuring nothing slips through the cracks.\nEnhancing signer experiences, building trust\n50%\nMore cost-effective\nthan DocuSign\n4.9/5\nCustomer\nsatisfaction score\n3 min\nAverage support response time\n0\nZero overage\npenalties\nSee what our partners have to say\nMarketing and Advertising\nAdam R.\nSales Director\nExceptional digital signature technology for less than the competition\nThis is an exceptional product for digital signature for less than the competition.\nTechnology\nAli P.\nVP Sales Engineering\nGreat flexible product with easy integration and customer support\nGreat company with very flexible tools and excellent customer experience.\nHospitality\nAmy K.\nDirector of Sales\nMakes my life much easier!\nThe two biggest positive changes are how much time I save completing the contract process and how quickly I receive the signed contracts back from the client.\nEducation\nAngelina B.\nSPED Coordinator\nLifesaver for Schools\nBlueink is very user-friendly. It is such a huge timesaver and allows our district to meet virtually and send and receive documents in real time. Users can also see when people have signed the documents, and who needs to sign with a reminder feature to resend the documents. I have no complaints about Blueink! All users are able to access the documents, sign them electronically, and receive a copy in a timely manner.\nFinancial Services\nAyaz S.\nManagement Consultant\nGreat Product and Value\nGreat value compared to other products and was easy to implement within our platforms. The company provides white glove service and support.\nGovernment\nBeth M.\nHuman Resources & Compliance\nHuman Resources paperwork streamlined\nBlueInk has streamlined our processes to ensure that all the required paperwork is collected in a timely manner with the proper signature.\nFAQs\nHow do I connect ServiceDesk Plus with Blueink?\n\nTo connect ServiceDesk Plus with Blueink, visit the Blueink Marketplace, find the ServiceDesk Plus option, and authorize the connection. Once connected, you can automate document workflows directly from your service requests.\n\n‍\n\nDo I need any additional tools to connect ServiceDesk Plus with Blueink?\n\nNo, you don’t need any additional tools or plugins. The integration is seamless and works directly between ServiceDesk Plus and Blueink.\n\nWhat can I do with the Blueink and ServiceDesk Plus integration?\n\nWith this integration, you can automatically send documents like approval forms, service agreements, and onboarding packets when certain service requests are triggered.\n\nIs the Blueink–ServiceDesk Plus integration secure?\n\nYes. Blueink uses encryption and follows industry-standard security practices to ensure that your documents and eSignatures are protected throughout the workflow.\n\nCan your team help me customize the integration?\n\nAbsolutely! We offer custom integration support tailored to your unique ServiceDesk Plus workflows. Reach out to us at integration@blueink.com and our team will assist you.\n\nReady to get started?\nGet in touch with Blueink.\nStart Free 14-Day Trial!\nFEATURES\nBulk Send\nSMS Delivery\nSmart Link Forms\nSigning Brands\nTeams\nIn-Person Signing\nSOLUTIONS\nINDUSTRY\nGovernment\nEducation\nHealthcare\nHousing\nInsurance\nStaffing\nSenior Living\n\nFinancial Services\nRetail\nTechnology\nDEPARTMENT\nFinance\nProcurement\nHuman Resources\nCourts\nLegal\nSales\nOperations\nCivil Service\nIT\nCOMPARE BLUEINK\nvs Adobe Sign\nvs DocuSign\nvs Dropbox Sign\nvs Foxit Sign\nvs PandaDoc\nvs SignNow\nAPI\nAPI Overview\nAPI SDKs & Libraries\nDocumentation\nAPI Plans & Pricing\nRESOURCES\nBlog\nWhite Papers\nCase Studies\nCompetitors\neSignature Laws\nHelp Center\nSample Documents\nFAQ\nCompliance\nSystem Status\nQUICK LINKS\nHome\nAbout Us\nPricing\nIntegration\nPartner\n\nContact Us\n2014 – 2026 © Blueink. All rights reserved.\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nCookies Policy"
